# 🌌 Braneworld Workbook UI

## 🧬 AuraXLSL Workbook Language

This is the workbook specification.

```md
WORKBOOK Braneworld

VERSION 1.0.0

ENGINE NeuroMindModel

NAMESPACE neuromindmodel.braneworld

SHEET Cortex
SHEET Synapse
SHEET Memory
SHEET Vision
SHEET Robotics
SHEET WorldModel

MODEL Voltron

RUNTIME BrainWorld
```

Example XLSL:

```xlsl
@Workbook Braneworld

worksheet Cortex

cell A1 = MODEL("Voltron")
cell A2 = MEMORY("hippocampus")
cell A3 = WORLD("Earth")

cell B1 = THINK(A1,A2)
cell B2 = PLAN(B1)
cell B3 = EXECUTE(B2)
```

## 🧠 Workbook Sheets

| Workbook             | Purpose |
| -------------------- | ------- |
|                      |         |
| Cortex.workbook.xlsl | Reasoning, planning, logic graph. |
| Synapse.workbook.xlsl |LoRA adapters,ControlNet-routing,neural connections. |
| Memory.workbook.xlsl | Hippocampus memory graph. |
| Vision.workbook.xlsl | Image understanding, ControlNet, diffusion. |
| Audio.workbook.xlsl  | Speech, Whisper, TTS. |
|Robotics.workbook.xlsl| Sensor fusion and embodied AI. |
|WorldModel.workbook.xlsl| Simulation and future prediction. |

