Python representation:

Python

Run

```
class MemoryNode:

    def __init__(self, id, kind, embedding):
        self.id = id
        self.kind = kind
        self.embedding = embedding
        self.edges = []

    def connect(self, relation, node):
        self.edges.append((relation, node))
```

