The World Model predicts future environment states.

```
Observe()

↓

Encode()

↓

Predict()

↓

Simulate()

↓

Plan()

↓

Act()
```

Workbook:

```
worksheet WorldModel

STATE = OBSERVE()

FUTURE = SIMULATE(STATE, horizon=20)

BEST = SELECT(FUTURE)

EXECUTE(BEST)
```

