![AI: A Technical History – Rowland Pettit](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/2XSfLobOzNk3Us68iqNSMV4hyaZ4daziyO8nFeL6SqAVboNJeRpGV2zFh37PX-EktATj2ktpSkxs9rbwb2f6SDwENFrsibnAQcsrOcW9Pi4IWemiruO86bEuug5H4McKs6Ksb3EXR-8mFGtWMVETExWmx3wdtSf84sYgvDeXKBU?purpose=inline)

![T5 Architecture: Text-to-Text Transfer Transformer Deep Dive - Interactive | Michael Brenndoerfer | Michael Brenndoerfer](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/9_kr-s5Ub45JtyBHFimTr9qLVjB3WesrP3qzYh0_yvF3MhsLkt7-g-TTppIJhCfdTHohowj6341qxd9xlCyP1JPckik1FkAbjtaaQDR9FsHCnEI7gF1ozcuxFYQ0YXBgJt_sv5CHmoGXQAR9wsNqDHtPv_Fn7PmK3Y9-fQS_7-8?purpose=inline)

5

```
worksheet Cortex

QUESTION = INPUT()

THOUGHT = THINK(QUESTION)

MEMORY = RETRIEVE(THOUGHT)

ANSWER = REASON(THOUGHT,MEMORY)

RETURN ANSWER
```

Reasoning pipeline:

1. Tokenize.

2. Retrieve memory.

3. Build reasoning graph.

4. Plan.

5. Respond.

## 📚 AuraXLSL Workbook Formula Library

| Function  | Description |
| --------- | ----------- |
|           |             |
|`THINK()`  | Cortex reasoning. |
|`PLAN()`   | Planner. |
|`MEMORY()` | Hippocampus retrieval. |
|`STORE()`  | Memory write. |
|`WORLD()`  | World simulation. |
|`SIMULATE()`| Future prediction. |
|`VISION()`| Image encoder. |
|`CONTROLNET()`| Diffusion conditioning. |
|`EXTRACT_LORA()`| Voltron adapter extraction. |
|`AGENT()`| Launch autonomous agent. |

