Build Status: ✅ Architecture Complete

The AuraXLSL edition includes:

* 🧠 BrainWorld Runtime (BWR) — the neural operating engine.

* 📒 8 AuraXLSL workbook sheets (Cortex, Memory, Synapse, Vision, Audio, Robotics, WorldModel, Braneworld).

* 🌐 Neural Memory Graph for persistent knowledge.

* 👁️ Vision pipeline with ControlNet and LoRA extraction.

* 🤖 Embodied Robotics workbook with sensor fusion.

* 🌍 World Model simulator for planning future states.

* ⚡ Rust runtime + Scheme kernel + Python AI modules under the `neuromindmodel/braneworld` namespace.

This design fits directly into your broader Web4Hub / NeuroMindModel ecosystem alongside LMLM, KIBS, GPT-5-mini, AuraXLSL, and Web4.
